COMMENT ON COLUMN deicing_request.earliest_reassign_time IS 'HOT 风险时系统给出的最早可重排起飞时刻（UTC），空值表示无风险';
COMMENT ON COLUMN deicing_request.fingerprint IS '幂等指纹：requestId 与全部业务字段 SHA-256';

